<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - J.C. Penney featured stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - J.C. Penney featured stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it named J.C. Penney Co Inc as its &quot;featured stock of week.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- J.C. Penney lost 9/16 to 56-3/16.</p>
</text>
